entations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice and Solutions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> (<span class=\"italic\">'d better</span>) instead of <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span>, especially in spoken English, to express that you think it would be sensible or advisable to do something. You do not use <span class=\"italic\">had better</span> to speak about the past. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I had better get out and walk to keep my legs strong.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We'd better make some changes now.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to do the laundry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to wash clothing  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I do the laundry every Saturday. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about healthy living.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "brain ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Close your computer and give your mind a rest!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "soft ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not strong or muscular ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Being in a car all the time makes us soft.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tweet ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "online posting on the social media website Twitter", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to check my tweets.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "social media", "type": "name"}, {"content": "websites where people participate in social networking   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd rather spend my leisure time on social media.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to consider", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think about ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I should consider getting more exercise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "millennial ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone born between 1990 and 2000  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Some millennials are active, while others are not.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and search for a 'senior citizen interview'.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to the interview and take notes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out what his or her life is like and was like. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use your notes to write a paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I find a senior citizen interview online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes about their life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph about their life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the paragraph to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le11ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob09re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "My grandmother has lived a long and healthy life. She has never had a job, but she has worked hard at home. She cleaned, cooked and did laundry for five children. That kept her busy."}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob09re2img02.jpg", "time": "13000", "id": 2, "text": "Grammy has never taken a fitness class. She would prefer to go for a long walk. She tells me I ought to shut down my computer more often and let my mind rest. I should spend less time sitting. I had better get out and walk to keep my legs strong. I know she's right. I would rather check my tweets or be on social media in the evening. I'd prefer to walk at the mall."}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob09re2img03.jpg", "time": "36000", "id": 3, "text": "Some millennials, like myself, would rather not think about ageing. We've just started our lives! We haven't considered that constantly sitting in front of screens isn't good for us. That always being in a car has already made us soft. If we want to still be healthy as we age, we'd better make some changes now."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le11ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le11ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn6le11ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le11ob09re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 2}, {"template_overr